  "content": "Guía paso a paso de<h2>: creación de un clúster Kubernetes de producción con Rancher RKE2 y Longhorn</h2><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"k8s-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E3F2FD\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"k8s-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#326CE5\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Arquitectura de clúster Kubernetes (RKE2)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#326CE5\">Nodos del plano de control</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo 1 (líder)</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API Servidor</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Programador</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo 2</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API Servidor</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Administrador de controlador</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo 3</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Servidor API</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Administrador de controlador</text><text x=\"630\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">Nodos de trabajo</text><rect x=\"530\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Trabajador 1</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kubelet</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-proxy</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"164\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Pods</text><rect x=\"670\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Trabajador 2</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kubelet</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-proxy</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"164\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Pods</text><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#326CE5\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"230\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFA726\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Capa de red Canal CNI (comunicación Pod-to-Pod)</text><line x1=\"265\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"310\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Capa de almacenamiento distribuido Longhorn</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"310\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">Configuración HA con 3 nodos de plano de control y conmutación por error automática</text></svg></div><h3>Paso 1: Instalar RKE2</h3><ol><li>Descargue el instalador de RKE2 desde el sitio web oficial de Rancher.</li><li>Ejecute<code>curl -sfL https://get.rke2.io | sh -</code>en cada nodo.</li><li>Iniciar el servicio RKE2:<code>systemctl enable rke2-server &amp;&amp; systemctl start rke2-server</code></li></ol><h3>Paso 2: Implementar Longhorn para almacenamiento</h3><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lh-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#F3E5F5\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"lh-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#7E57C2\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#lh-bg)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4527A0\">Integración de almacenamiento distribuido Longhorn</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">App Pod A</text><text x=\"145\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC Claim</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">App Pod B</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC Claim</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"485\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">App Pod C</text><text x=\"485\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC Claim</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">StatefulSet</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC Claim</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"140\" width=\"400\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Controlador y controlador Longhorn CSI. Motor</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\">Programación y control de volumen Administrador de replicación</text><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"485\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"675\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo de trabajo 1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Réplica A1 y B1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Almacenamiento SSD</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">Destino iSCSI</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo de trabajo 2</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Réplica A2 &amp; C1</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Almacenamiento SSD</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">Destino iSCSI</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Nodo de trabajo 3</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Réplica B2 &amp; C2</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">Almacenamiento SSD</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">Destino iSCSI</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">Cada volumen se replica en nodos para alta disponibilidad</text></svg></div><ol><li>Instalar Helm:<code>curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/master/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash</code></li><li>Agregar repositorio de Longhorn:<code>helm repo add longhorn https://charts.longhorn.io</code></li><li>Instalar bocina larga:<code>helm install longhorn longhorn/longhorn --namespace longhorn-system --create-namespace</code></li></ol>Diagrama de arquitectura<h3></h3><img src='/img/ai-neural-network.jpg' alt='Kubernetes Cluster Architecture Diagram' style='max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;'/><h3>Notas técnicas</h3><ul><li>Utilice almacenamiento SSD para obtener el mejor rendimiento.</li><li>Asegúrese de que todos los nodos tengan nombres de host únicos e IP estáticas.</li><li>Configure firewalls para permitir puertos Kubernetes.</li></ul><h3>Cómo: verificar el estado del clúster</h3><pre><code>kubectl get nodes\nkubectl get pods -A\nkubectl get storageclass</code></pre><h3>Las mejores guías de vídeos de YouTube</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhBSlnQcq2g' target='_blank'>Kubernetes Tutorial para principiantes [TechWorld con Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VnvRrz9fK_U' target='_blank'>Curso completo de Kubernetes: aprenda Kubernetes en 8 horas | Tutorial Kubernetes | Edureka</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vw1h8ZNmFvA' target='_blank'>Rancher RKE2 Kubernetes Configuración del clúster [Rancher Labs]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>Almacenamiento Longhorn para Kubernetes [TechWorld con Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PH-2FfFD2PU' target='_blank'>Kubernetes Explicado en 15 minutos [Academind]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7bA0gTroJjw' target='_blank'>Kubernetes Análisis profundo de redes [Google Cloud Tech]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>Almacenamiento Longhorn para Kubernetes [TechWorld con Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KqvK5K3nR6A' target='_blank'>Kubernetes Mejores prácticas de seguridad [TechWorld con Nana]</a></li></ul>Tutoriales en vídeo de<h3></h3><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhBSlnQcq2g' title='Kubernetes Setup Demo' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/VnvRrz9fK_U' title='Kubernetes Full Course' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vw1h8ZNmFvA' title='Rancher RKE2 Kubernetes Cluster Setup' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qn3jYj8pQjA' title='Longhorn Storage for Kubernetes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/PH-2FfFD2PU' title='Kubernetes Explained in 15 Minutes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/7bA0gTroJjw' title='Kubernetes Networking Deep Dive' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/KqvK5K3nR6A' title='Kubernetes Security Best Practices' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>Recursos adicionales</h3><ul><li><a href='https://rancher.com/docs/rke2/latest/es/' target='_blank'>Rancher RKE2 Documentación oficial</a></li><li><a href='https://longhorn.io/docs/' target='_blank'>Documentos oficiales de almacenamiento Longhorn</a></li><li><a href='https://kubernetes.io/docs/home/' target='_blank'>Kubernetes Documentación oficial</a></li></ul><h3>Problemas comunes y solución de problemas</h3><ul>El nodo<li>no se une: verifique el firewall y el token.</li>Los pods<li>Longhorn no se ejecutan: verifique la clase de almacenamiento y las etiquetas de los nodos.</li><li>Problemas de red: revise la configuración del complemento CNI.</li></ul>",
